<title>UK: Argentina's Camuzzi sets $130 mln five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Camuzzi sets $130 mln five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Merrill Lynch and Societe Generale and has been preplaced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAMUZZI</p>
<p> AMT    $130 MLN	COUPON     9.25	MATURITY    15.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.80     PAY DATE    11.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     LISTING    *	   PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	*BUENOS AIRES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
